ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/202607040503175129_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/202607040503175129_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/match1867437date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进8强！法国1-0巴拉圭将战摩洛哥 姆巴佩点射杜埃造点主裁引争议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260705/zhanbao_image_1867437_1783205971_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260705/zhanbao_image_1867437_1783205971_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260705/zhanbao_image_1867437_1783205971_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">杜埃造点，姆巴佩主罚命中，姆巴佩世界杯总进球数达到19球，仅次于梅西的20球。法国1-0击败巴拉圭，进入8强，将对阵摩洛哥。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/match1867438date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进8强！摩洛哥3-0加拿大将战法国 乌纳希双响迪亚斯两助</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260705/zhanbao_image_1867438_1783192031_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260705/zhanbao_image_1867438_1783192031_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260705/zhanbao_image_1867438_1783192031_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">乌纳希双响，迪亚斯两献助攻，摩洛哥3-0加拿大晋级八强，将对阵法国。</span></p><p><strong>【世界杯资讯】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/6a496cdb7d27enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">上届亚军vs上届殿军！世界杯首组1/4决赛对阵：法国vs摩洛哥</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/202607050501367549.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/202607050501367549.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/202607050501367549.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">美加墨世界杯1/8决赛，法国淘汰巴拉圭，连续4届晋级八强。1/4决赛，他们的对手是淘汰了加拿大的摩洛哥。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/6a497198ad9cdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">只差1球！世界杯历史进球榜：姆巴佩19场19球，只落后榜首梅西1球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/202607050504214235.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/202607050504214235.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/202607050504214235.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">姆巴佩的个人世界杯总进球数来到19场19球，只差梅西1球！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/6a496f0f4e164native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">这次如何？法国队连续4届晋级八强，2014不敌德国，近两届1冠1亚</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a44502828f4e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a44502828f4e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a44502828f4e.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">法国淘汰巴拉圭，连续4届晋级八强。过去两届世界杯法国均闯入决赛，2018年击败克罗地亚夺冠，2022年不敌阿根廷获得亚军。2014年世界杯法国同样闯入八强，1/4决赛被最终冠军德国淘汰。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/6a492ead5ef23native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创非洲历史！摩洛哥连续两届晋级世界杯8强，1/4决赛将战法国</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/6a495a312d21b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/6a495a312d21b_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/6a495a312d21b_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">摩洛哥连续两届晋级世界杯8强，成为非洲第一支两进世界杯8强的球队。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/6a4990556fd9fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">判罚引争议！巴拉圭多次小动作全场13犯规0黄牌，法国11犯规3黄牌</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/6a497f6bc2eab_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/6a497f6bc2eab.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/6a497f6bc2eab.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">美加墨世界杯1/8决赛，法国1-0战胜巴拉圭。全场比赛中巴拉圭被吹13次犯规，没有获得黄牌，法国队全场11次犯规，吃到3张黄牌。本场比赛乌兹别克斯坦主裁判坦塔舍夫的判罚也引起了争议。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/6a493cd75ca7dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">临时救火两场全败！突尼斯主帅勒纳尔自宣离任：我的冒险就此结束</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/6a376f50ae16c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/6a376f50ae16c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260621/6a376f50ae16c.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">美加墨世界杯小组赛阶段，突尼斯在小组赛中全败出局。突尼斯救火主帅勒纳尔在个人社媒自宣离任。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-05/6a4980d6f2a9fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">真的生气了！奥莱报解读唇语：姆巴佩向对手说了脏话“你妈的X”</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260705/202607050554082255.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; displa